<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="461519782"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="6801524444"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Chasing Colors"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Marshmello / Noah Cyrus / Ookay"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Chasing Colors"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:15.200"><div begin="00:13.113" end="03:10.594"><p begin="00:13.113" end="00:16.995" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">We're dreaming on and on, we're dreaming on and on<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">梦啊 梦啊 不停地绘出梦想</span></p><p begin="00:19.497" end="00:23.456" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">We got the windows down, we got the windows down<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们关上了这扇窗</span></p><p begin="00:25.419" end="00:32.073" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">I'm chasing all of the colors in my head, I wanna feel alive<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">追逐着脑海中的绚烂色彩 我想要重获新生</span></p><p begin="00:32.265" end="00:36.417" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">I'm living high, high, high<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻我正活得精彩</span></p><p begin="00:37.079" end="00:38.507" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">I'm living high<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">活得美好</span></p><p begin="01:02.702" end="01:04.098" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">I'm living high<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">活得精彩</span></p><p begin="01:29.873" end="01:33.792" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">We're dreaming on and on, we're dreaming on and on<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">梦啊 梦啊 不停地绘出梦想</span></p><p begin="01:36.324" end="01:40.194" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">The stars are all around, the stars are all around<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">星辰洒满你身旁 洒满你身旁</span></p><p begin="01:42.233" end="01:48.925" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">I'm chasing all of the colors in my head, I wanna feel alive<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">追逐着脑海中的绚烂色彩 我想要重获新生</span></p><p begin="01:49.093" end="01:53.272" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">I'm living high, high, high<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻我正活得精彩</span></p><p begin="01:53.853" end="01:55.263" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">I'm living high<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">活得美好</span></p><p begin="02:19.487" end="02:20.874" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">I'm living high<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">活得精彩</span></p><p begin="02:46.726" end="02:51.246" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">I got this fire in my heart and I'm feeling alright<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我心斗志满满战火重燃</span></p><p begin="02:53.075" end="02:57.492" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">I got this feeling in my head that we're doing alright<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我有所直觉这次我就可以定成败</span></p><p begin="03:00.024" end="03:04.053" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">Breaking down the walls, I'm living high<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">冲破层层阻拦 我要活得绚烂精彩</span></p><p begin="03:07.204" end="03:10.594" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">Chasing all the colors<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">追逐心中那千万色彩</span></p></div></body></tt>